WEBVTT

00:00:00.529 --> 00:00:02.106
I'M TELLING YOU,
IT'S SPOOKY.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.370
SHE KNOWS MORE
ABOUT YOU THAN YOU DO.

00:00:04.413 --> 00:00:05.371
WHO DOESN'T?

00:00:05.414 --> 00:00:06.763
AAH!
[GASPS]

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:09.984
WHAT'S HAPPENING?

00:00:10.027 --> 00:00:13.292
THE STAIRCASES
CHANGE, REMEMBER?

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:20.647
LET'S GO
THIS WAY.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:23.389
BEFORE THE STAIRCASE
MOVES AGAIN.

00:00:31.832 --> 00:00:35.401
Ron: DOES ANYBODY FEEL LIKE
WE SHOULDN'T BE HERE?

00:00:35.444 --> 00:00:37.794
WE'RE NOT SUPPOSED
TO BE HERE.

00:00:37.838 --> 00:00:40.319
THIS IS THE THIRD FLOOR.
IT'S FORBIDDEN.

00:00:42.495 --> 00:00:43.452
LET'S GO.

00:00:43.496 --> 00:00:45.628
[MEOWING]

00:00:47.151 --> 00:00:48.109
IT'S FILCH'S CAT!

00:00:48.152 --> 00:00:49.153
RUN!

00:00:53.157 --> 00:00:56.422
QUICK. LET'S HIDE
THROUGH THAT DOOR.

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:02.602
IT'S LOCKED!

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:04.430
THAT'S IT.
WE'RE DONE FOR.

00:01:04.473 --> 00:01:05.822
OH, MOVE OVER!

00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:08.259
ALOHOMORA.

00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:11.350
GET IN.

00:01:13.482 --> 00:01:14.831
"ALOHOMORA?"

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:17.181
STANDARD BOOK OF SPELLS,
CHAPTER 7.

00:01:17.225 --> 00:01:20.010
ANYONE HERE,
MY SWEET?

00:01:20.054 --> 00:01:22.273
[MEOWS]

00:01:27.061 --> 00:01:28.062
COME ON.

00:01:29.063 --> 00:01:30.194
FILCH IS GONE.

00:01:30.238 --> 00:01:31.500
PROBABLY THINKS
THIS DOOR'S LOCKED.

00:01:31.544 --> 00:01:32.632
IT WASLOCKED.

00:01:32.675 --> 00:01:34.460
AND FOR
GOOD REASON.

00:01:34.503 --> 00:01:36.331
[GROWLS]

00:01:38.115 --> 00:01:40.030
[YAWNS]

00:01:40.074 --> 00:01:41.162
[GROWLS]

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:45.253
[ALL GROWLING]

00:01:46.254 --> 00:01:49.562
AAH!AAH!

00:01:53.609 --> 00:01:55.611
[GRUNTING]

00:02:01.008 --> 00:02:02.705
WHAT DO THEY THINK
THEY'RE DOING,

00:02:02.749 --> 00:02:04.228
KEEPING
A THING LIKE THAT

00:02:04.272 --> 00:02:06.230
LOCKED UP
IN A SCHOOL?

00:02:06.274 --> 00:02:08.494
YOU DON'T USE
YOUR EYES, DO YOU?

00:02:08.537 --> 00:02:10.365
DIDN'T YOU SEE WHAT
IT WAS STANDING ON?

00:02:10.409 --> 00:02:12.541
I WASN'T LOOKING
AT ITS FEET!

00:02:12.585 --> 00:02:14.630
I WAS A BIT PREOCCUPIED
WITH ITS HEADS.

00:02:14.674 --> 00:02:16.893
OR MAYBE YOU
DIDN'T NOTICE

00:02:16.937 --> 00:02:17.981
THERE WERE 3!

00:02:18.025 --> 00:02:19.418
IT WAS STANDING
ON A TRAP DOOR,

00:02:19.461 --> 00:02:21.594
WHICH MEANS IT WASN'T
THERE BY ACCIDENT.

00:02:21.637 --> 00:02:23.204
IT'S GUARDING SOMETHING.

00:02:23.247 --> 00:02:25.380
GUARDING SOMETHING?

00:02:25.424 --> 00:02:26.860
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:02:26.903 --> 00:02:29.689
NOW, IF YOU TWO DON'T MIND,
I'M GOING TO BED

00:02:29.732 --> 00:02:31.125
BEFORE EITHER
OF YOU COME UP

00:02:31.168 --> 00:02:33.388
WITH ANOTHER CLEVER IDEA
TO GET US KILLED.

00:02:33.432 --> 00:02:35.825
OR WORSE, EXPELLED.

00:02:39.568 --> 00:02:43.267
SHE NEEDS TO SORT OUT
HER PRIORITIES.

00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:51.537
QUIDDITCH IS EASY ENOUGH
TO UNDERSTAND.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.060
EACH TEAM HAS 7 PLAYERS:

00:02:53.103 --> 00:02:54.203
3 CHASERS, 2 BEATERS,

